# Armchair (make_armchair3.py): the stuff tones on the Fabric swatch. Armchairs are made of Fabric and Leathery stuff only; {stuff} would pick Metal for them.
newmtl stuff_armchair
Kd 1.000 1.000 1.000
map_Kd IsoRim/Swatches/Fabric

newmtl stuff_armchair_dark
Kd 0.800 0.800 0.800
map_Kd IsoRim/Swatches/Fabric

newmtl stuff_armchair_deep
Kd 0.620 0.620 0.620
map_Kd IsoRim/Swatches/Fabric
